{"5308690":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"BITS OVERLOAD","steam_appid":5308690,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY HAND HAS TWO PROBLEMS: THE NUMBER AND THE ENEMY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BITS OVERLOAD<\/strong> is a tactical sci-fi card battler built around precision.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reactor has a target value. More energy is not always better: <strong>you need to hit the target exactly<\/strong> while an enemy ship is trying to destroy yours.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stabilize the reactor, or change your plan and destroy the opposing ship first.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOUR WAYS TO PLAY. FOUR KINDS OF PRESSURE. ONE IS CLASSIFIED.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS<\/strong><br>Push farther and farther, sector after sector. Adapt your strategy, manage your resources, and see how long you can survive when every decision makes the next one more important.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY MODE • 30 SECTORS<\/strong><br>Fight through a 30-sector campaign and stop <strong>Lord Srad Raven<\/strong> before he can seize the energy of the universe. Two reactors, new tactical situations, and a battle that unfolds sector by sector.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIME ATTACK • 20 SECTORS • 10 MINUTES<\/strong><br>Time is a resource. You have <strong>10 minutes<\/strong> to face 20 sectors: play fast, earn precious seconds, and decide when to take risks to keep the run alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MODE 04 • CLASSIFIED<\/strong><br>A fourth mode exists.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We won't tell you how it works.<br>We won't tell you what it contains.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll have to discover it yourself.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS. STORY. TIME ATTACK. [CLASSIFIED]<\/strong><br><strong>STABILIZE. ATTACK. SURVIVE.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIT THE EXACT TARGET<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card changes the equation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the right sequence, manipulate your reactor value and decide which cards are worth playing now — and which ones should stay in your hand for later.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong turn solves the problem in front of you.<br>A great sequence prepares the next one too.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE OVERLOAD<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond the reactor target and you enter <strong>Overload<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can still bring the reactor back under control during the same sequence, but another mistake can push it toward disaster.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn when to avoid the risk, when to recover from it, and when to deliberately chase a <strong>Perfect Overload<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overload is not just a penalty. It is part of the strategy.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO WAYS TO WIN<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle gives you two possible objectives.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stabilize the reactor<\/strong> by reaching the exact target...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or <strong>destroy the enemy ship<\/strong> before it destroys you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, build shields, repair your hull and manipulate the battlefield. A hand that looked perfect for reactor stabilization may suddenly become the fastest route to a kill.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowing when to change your objective is part of the battle.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CARDS YOU KEEP STILL MATTER<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unused cards do not automatically disappear at the end of the turn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep useful cards, prepare future combinations and decide when spending resources to replace part of your hand is worth it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hand is not just a set of actions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It is a plan.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADAPT TO ANOMALIES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs can be disrupted by <strong>Anomalies<\/strong> that alter how the battle looks and plays.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden cards, visual distortions and other effects can force you to rethink a situation that seemed under control only moments before.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the battlefield. Adapt your sequence. Keep the reactor under control.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK A FLEET OF 100 SHIPS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your Hangar with <strong>100 unlockable ships<\/strong>, organized across different rarities and classes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship classes provide <strong>small tactical bonuses<\/strong> such as starting shields, opening-hand advantages, bonuses to specific actions and other subtle gameplay variations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach new sectors, improve your score and complete unlock conditions to expand your fleet.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship does not replace your strategy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It gives you a different edge when the run begins.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW FAR CAN YOU GO?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition begins again from the first sector.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new enemies, deal with Anomalies, unlock ships, earn medals and push your score and sector record further with every run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the game asks you to understand its systems rather than simply play stronger cards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit the target. Control the Overload. Or destroy everything in your way.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHASE YOUR RECORDS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition feeds your persistent statistics: push your score higher, reach new sectors and turn each run into another attempt to beat your personal best.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your performance through Steam leaderboards, unlock achievements and keep your progress synchronized with Steam Cloud.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is another chance to go farther, play cleaner and climb higher.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY HAND HAS TWO PROBLEMS: THE NUMBER AND THE ENEMY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BITS OVERLOAD<\/strong> is a tactical sci-fi card battler built around precision.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reactor has a target value. More energy is not always better: <strong>you need to hit the target exactly<\/strong> while an enemy ship is trying to destroy yours.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stabilize the reactor, or change your plan and destroy the opposing ship first.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOUR WAYS TO PLAY. FOUR KINDS OF PRESSURE. ONE IS CLASSIFIED.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS<\/strong><br>Push farther and farther, sector after sector. Adapt your strategy, manage your resources, and see how long you can survive when every decision makes the next one more important.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY MODE • 30 SECTORS<\/strong><br>Fight through a 30-sector campaign and stop <strong>Lord Srad Raven<\/strong> before he can seize the energy of the universe. Two reactors, new tactical situations, and a battle that unfolds sector by sector.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIME ATTACK • 20 SECTORS • 10 MINUTES<\/strong><br>Time is a resource. You have <strong>10 minutes<\/strong> to face 20 sectors: play fast, earn precious seconds, and decide when to take risks to keep the run alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MODE 04 • CLASSIFIED<\/strong><br>A fourth mode exists.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We won't tell you how it works.<br>We won't tell you what it contains.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll have to discover it yourself.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS. STORY. TIME ATTACK. [CLASSIFIED]<\/strong><br><strong>STABILIZE. ATTACK. SURVIVE.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIT THE EXACT TARGET<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card changes the equation.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the right sequence, manipulate your reactor value and decide which cards are worth playing now — and which ones should stay in your hand for later.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong turn solves the problem in front of you.<br>A great sequence prepares the next one too.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE OVERLOAD<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond the reactor target and you enter <strong>Overload<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can still bring the reactor back under control during the same sequence, but another mistake can push it toward disaster.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn when to avoid the risk, when to recover from it, and when to deliberately chase a <strong>Perfect Overload<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overload is not just a penalty. It is part of the strategy.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO WAYS TO WIN<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle gives you two possible objectives.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stabilize the reactor<\/strong> by reaching the exact target...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or <strong>destroy the enemy ship<\/strong> before it destroys you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, build shields, repair your hull and manipulate the battlefield. A hand that looked perfect for reactor stabilization may suddenly become the fastest route to a kill.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowing when to change your objective is part of the battle.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CARDS YOU KEEP STILL MATTER<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unused cards do not automatically disappear at the end of the turn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep useful cards, prepare future combinations and decide when spending resources to replace part of your hand is worth it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hand is not just a set of actions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It is a plan.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADAPT TO ANOMALIES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs can be disrupted by <strong>Anomalies<\/strong> that alter how the battle looks and plays.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden cards, visual distortions and other effects can force you to rethink a situation that seemed under control only moments before.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the battlefield. Adapt your sequence. Keep the reactor under control.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK A FLEET OF 100 SHIPS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your Hangar with <strong>100 unlockable ships<\/strong>, organized across different rarities and classes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship classes provide <strong>small tactical bonuses<\/strong> such as starting shields, opening-hand advantages, bonuses to specific actions and other subtle gameplay variations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach new sectors, improve your score and complete unlock conditions to expand your fleet.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship does not replace your strategy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It gives you a different edge when the run begins.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW FAR CAN YOU GO?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition begins again from the first sector.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new enemies, deal with Anomalies, unlock ships, earn medals and push your score and sector record further with every run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the game asks you to understand its systems rather than simply play stronger cards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit the target. Control the Overload. Or destroy everything in your way.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHASE YOUR RECORDS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition feeds your persistent statistics: push your score higher, reach new sectors and turn each run into another attempt to beat your personal best.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your performance through Steam leaderboards, unlock achievements and keep your progress synchronized with Steam Cloud.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is another chance to go farther, play cleaner and climb higher.<\/p>","short_description":"A tactical sci-fi card battler where every hand has two problems: the number and the enemy. Hit the reactor target exactly, manage Overload, plan your sequences, or change course and destroy the opposing ship.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/490f43d1851af010b3f69ff7ddf18662f32d4825\/header.jpg?t=1793661792","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/f95af2b9f799e1bc795908da501c48a7b5b856de\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793661792","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/f95af2b9f799e1bc795908da501c48a7b5b856de\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793661792","website":"https:\/\/www.sradraven.com\/games\/bits-overload\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 64-bit dual-core processor, 2.0 GHz or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 2.1 compatible graphics card<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any standard audio device<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"© 2026 SRADRAVEN. All rights reserved.","developers":["SRADRAVEN"],"publishers":["SRADRAVEN"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":999,"final":999,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"9,99€"},"packages":[1834860],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy BITS OVERLOAD","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1834860,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"BITS OVERLOAD - 9,99€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":999}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":64,"description":"Adjustable Text Size"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":66,"description":"Color Alternatives"},{"id":82,"description":"#category_contrast_controls"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":75,"description":"Keyboard Only Option"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":15,"description":"Stats"},{"id":25,"description":"Steam Leaderboards"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/573493a05601d9f613a9c16aa6044ee63e2fbdf7\/ss_573493a05601d9f613a9c16aa6044ee63e2fbdf7.600x338.jpg?t=1793661792","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/573493a05601d9f613a9c16aa6044ee63e2fbdf7\/ss_573493a05601d9f613a9c16aa6044ee63e2fbdf7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793661792"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/08330b3ed4c50e7473f2742a82d653494be3c845\/ss_08330b3ed4c50e7473f2742a82d653494be3c845.600x338.jpg?t=1793661792","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/08330b3ed4c50e7473f2742a82d653494be3c845\/ss_08330b3ed4c50e7473f2742a82d653494be3c845.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793661792"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/67d60d3170ceca5d770d48b479cec79c5875315f\/ss_67d60d3170ceca5d770d48b479cec79c5875315f.600x338.jpg?t=1793661792","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/67d60d3170ceca5d770d48b479cec79c5875315f\/ss_67d60d3170ceca5d770d48b479cec79c5875315f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793661792"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/3631ed602b85e5151727d82a8a76955aa7476cb5\/ss_3631ed602b85e5151727d82a8a76955aa7476cb5.600x338.jpg?t=1793661792","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/3631ed602b85e5151727d82a8a76955aa7476cb5\/ss_3631ed602b85e5151727d82a8a76955aa7476cb5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793661792"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/40b92170347f074105a61a8f4955dd049d2444c3\/ss_40b92170347f074105a61a8f4955dd049d2444c3.600x338.jpg?t=1793661792","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/40b92170347f074105a61a8f4955dd049d2444c3\/ss_40b92170347f074105a61a8f4955dd049d2444c3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793661792"}],"movies":[{"id":257441632,"name":"BITS OVERLOAD – Gameplay Trailer 3 Novembre","thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/257441632\/8ed48fc92de871920c791b32955d106dcf59dbc7\/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790803218","dash_av1":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/5308690\/315509592\/6cd9ea5e5b78479fe6622c65375ae1fed6574b47\/1790802110\/dash_av1.mpd?t=1790803218","dash_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/5308690\/315509592\/6cd9ea5e5b78479fe6622c65375ae1fed6574b47\/1790802110\/dash_h264.mpd?t=1790803218","hls_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/5308690\/315509592\/6cd9ea5e5b78479fe6622c65375ae1fed6574b47\/1790802110\/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790803218","highlight":true},{"id":257431226,"name":"BITS OVERLOAD – Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/257431226\/d8be55a12cf55fbf360224f5424baf3d8613f09a\/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790803219","dash_av1":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/5308690\/249716360\/7352943ee0748dbe8a8655727202399ee91ee38b\/1790054341\/dash_av1.mpd?t=1790803219","dash_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/5308690\/249716360\/7352943ee0748dbe8a8655727202399ee91ee38b\/1790054341\/dash_h264.mpd?t=1790803219","hls_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/5308690\/249716360\/7352943ee0748dbe8a8655727202399ee91ee38b\/1790054341\/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790803219","highlight":true}],"achievements":{"total":33,"highlighted":[{"icon":"4d694c2a9925cf829acb603cbd8e92fd16051068.jpg","localized_name":"First Contact","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"First Contact","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5308690\/4d694c2a9925cf829acb603cbd8e92fd16051068.jpg"},{"icon":"a4219129b5bcde4a0760117cf359f1d841e3af65.jpg","localized_name":"Precision Engineer","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Precision Engineer","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5308690\/a4219129b5bcde4a0760117cf359f1d841e3af65.jpg"},{"icon":"16d3d0bf5dd7f0d5dc44798893c32fca87223a91.jpg","localized_name":"Overload","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Overload","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5308690\/16d3d0bf5dd7f0d5dc44798893c32fca87223a91.jpg"},{"icon":"15804878654a976a8fc3f1ae9e3e17ad3e24088f.jpg","localized_name":"Controlled Chaos","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Controlled Chaos","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5308690\/15804878654a976a8fc3f1ae9e3e17ad3e24088f.jpg"},{"icon":"a57d530566a28ffe5f199edf6d03e60896442a3e.jpg","localized_name":"Perfect Overload","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Perfect Overload","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5308690\/a57d530566a28ffe5f199edf6d03e60896442a3e.jpg"},{"icon":"00e6911091232f120b1f43c787af6223370ce85d.jpg","localized_name":"Fire First","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Fire First","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5308690\/00e6911091232f120b1f43c787af6223370ce85d.jpg"},{"icon":"c623572e21b0fd923acc51123cdfc1368ab2c793.jpg","localized_name":"Pirata Burlone","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Pirata Burlone","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5308690\/c623572e21b0fd923acc51123cdfc1368ab2c793.jpg"},{"icon":"6cafe04e20b37989e74c2607e3a1779f1dc15083.jpg","localized_name":"Anomaly Survivor","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Anomaly Survivor","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5308690\/6cafe04e20b37989e74c2607e3a1779f1dc15083.jpg"},{"icon":"dde4d06d62ca83ad94a82426acf9d1a73c91d07b.jpg","localized_name":"No Waste","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"No Waste","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5308690\/dde4d06d62ca83ad94a82426acf9d1a73c91d07b.jpg"},{"icon":"0f610aa7bd4b6723b771aa27150544c314457a78.jpg","localized_name":"Untouched","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Untouched","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/5308690\/0f610aa7bd4b6723b771aa27150544c314457a78.jpg"}]},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"2 Nov, 2026"},"support_info":{"url":"https:\/\/www.sradraven.com\/","email":"sradraven@sradraven.com"},"background":"https:\/\/store.akamai.steamstatic.com\/images\/storepagebackground\/app\/5308690?t=1793661792","background_raw":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5308690\/cec4904a0742f5cd2310ab0ebcfd1b7ff8a365f2\/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1793661792","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"10","required_age":"10","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Violência"},"steam_germany":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"12","required_age":"12","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt"}}}}}